title: GreedExplanation

---
Greed: At the start of every round, both of us will buy two cards.
Greed: The difference is that I will buy one faced down card.
Greed: Every round you will have 2 options: Buy or Stand.
Greed: If you decide to buy a card, you can decide if it will be positive...
Greed: Or negative for your score.
Greed: If you decide to buy a negative one, you will receive the value of the card in burn.
Greed: The table will display the max burn you can take.
Greed: Remember: If you reach the maximum, you lose.
Greed: I will always play after you, with the same options.
Greed: Every card will count negativily or positivily for your score.
Greed: Jacks, Queens and Kings values 10 to your score.
Greed: Aces values 11, but if you exceed the target, it will value 1.
Greed: But for burn value. It <shake>ALWAYS</shake> values 11.
Greed: Wins the one who come closer to the target score.
Greed: The table will always display that too.
Greed: You good? or want me to repeat that?
-> I'm good.
-> Repeat it, please.
    <<jump GreedExplanation>>
===